---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import MotionKit from '../components/MotionKit.astro';
import '../styles/utility-pages.css';
---

<Layout title="Essential Clean™ Booking Request | High Quality Clean" description="Submit an Essential Clean™ booking request. HQC reviews suitability and availability before confirming the booking." robots="noindex, follow">
  <Header />
  <MotionKit />
  <main class="hm-page utility-page utility-book min-h-screen bg-porcelain pt-20 text-midnight">
    <section class="utility-hero utility-book-hero hm-dark bg-midnight text-white"><div class="utility-shell utility-hero-copy">
      <p class="section-kicker hm-kicker-line">Essential Clean™</p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 font-serif text-4xl md:text-6xl">Request an Essential Clean™ booking</h1>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-white/85">Choose one-off, weekly or fortnightly where available. Your submission is a booking request. HQC checks the home, availability, cleaner allocation and applicable payment requirements before sending confirmation.</p>
    </div><figure class="utility-book-photo"><img src="/images/phase8-nov10/r-bed-made.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="800" height="600" decoding="async" /></figure></section>
    <div class="utility-shell utility-book-body">
      <div class="utility-book-notices">
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl leading-7 text-slate" data-reveal>Entering payment details does not itself collect payment or confirm a booking. HQC decides whether a deposit or payment applies to your service and collects it where required before sending its confirmation email.</p>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl leading-7 text-slate" data-reveal>If you select Heavy Build-Up / Restoration Required, HQC will contact you before any confirmation because a different service or assessment may be needed. The 30% first-clean offer is for eligible new weekly or fortnightly clients with a three-month commitment, subject to the <a class="underline" href="/terms-and-conditions/">Terms</a>. One-off bookings do not qualify.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="utility-book-widget mt-10 border border-midnight/10 bg-white p-3 sm:p-6">
        <iframe
          id="booking-widget-iframe"
          title="Essential Clean booking request through Launch27"
          src="https://highqualitycleanlimited.launch27.com/?w_cleaning"
          class="block min-h-[850px] w-full border-0"
          scrolling="auto"
          referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
        ></iframe>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-slate">Read HQC’s <a class="font-semibold underline" href="/terms-and-conditions/">Terms and Conditions</a> and <a class="font-semibold underline" href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a> before submitting your request.</p>
      <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-slate">If the form does not load, <a class="hm-cta-link utility-inline-cta" href="https://highqualitycleanlimited.launch27.com/?w_cleaning" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">open the booking request in a new tab <span class="hm-cta-chip" aria-hidden="true"></span></a>. You can also <a class="hm-cta-link hm-cta-secondary utility-inline-cta" href="/request-a-quote/?route=residential&service=essential-clean&buyer=home">ask HQC to check suitability <span class="hm-cta-chip" aria-hidden="true"></span></a>.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>

<script is:inline>
  window.addEventListener('load', () => window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('hqc:conversion', { detail: { event: 'booking_request_started' } })), { once: true });
  window.addEventListener('message', (event) => {
    if (event.origin !== 'https://highqualitycleanlimited.launch27.com') return;
    if (event.data?.type !== 'iframeHeight') return;
    const height = Number(event.data.height);
    const iframe = document.getElementById('booking-widget-iframe');
    if (iframe && event.source === iframe.contentWindow && Number.isFinite(height) && height >= 300 && height <= 10000) iframe.style.height = `${height}px`;
  });
</script>
